OL,3,ACalvin Harris recognised for 1.6m world
OL,4,Arecord DJ set crowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish DJ Calvin Harris has been
OL,7,Fcelebrating writing his name into the
OL,8,Frecord books after performing for an
OL,9,Festimated 1.6m people in Sao Paulo
OL,10,Fearlier this year.
OL,12,FThe musician from Dumfries received
OL,13,Frecognition from Guinness World Records
OL,14,F(GWR) for the largest attendance for a
OL,15,FDJ set by a single artist.
OL,17,FHe took to social media to highlight
OL,18,Fthe award for what he described as a
OL,19,F"truly insane day" which he said could
OL,20,Fonly have happened in Brazil.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,169,160,200,105,0,100
