OL,3,ACalvin Harris recognised for 1.6m world
OL,4,Arecord DJ set crowd
OL,5,
OL,6,FGWR said it had been reported that his
OL,7,Fheadline appearance had forced the
OL,8,Fclosure of the Rua da Consolacao with
OL,9,Fsome fans fainting in the heat.
